second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"When was Corruption Watch established?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 248, \"text\": \"Corruption Watch (South Africa) Corruption Watch is a South African non-governmental organisation which monitors incidents of corruption that involve public resources, trade union resources, lottery and donated charitable resources in South Africa.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00\", \"start\": 249, \"end\": 391, \"text\": \"Corruption Watch was launched in January 2012 at the initiative of trade union federation COSATU (the Congress of South African Trade Unions).\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00\", \"start\": 392, \"end\": 542, \"text\": \"In 2016, Corruption Watch called for the resignation of President Zuma, stating that he wasn't doing enough to prevent corruption of public officials.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00\", \"start\": 543, \"end\": 696, \"text\": \"Corruption Watch operates a reporting process which encourages members of the public to report their experiences of corruption through SMS, fax, email or\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 58, \"text\": \"employees were seen by their colleagues to be on the take.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d01\", \"start\": 59, \"end\": 302, \"text\": \"While some attribute the current situation to a foundation of corruption laid during the reign of Indonesian strongman President Suharto, others blame a persisting 'culture of corruption' in Indonesia and the region that predates World War II.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d01\", \"start\": 303, \"end\": 623, \"text\": \"ICW was created on June 21, 1998, a few weeks after the resignation of President Suharto, by social activist Teten Masduki, lawyer Todung Mulya Lubis, economist Faisal Basri and other persons in the midst of a reform movement aimed at ensuring that any post-Suharto government would be democratic and free of corruption.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"cases have been successfully handled by the KPK , the Attorney General 's Office , and the police .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d02\", \"start\": 100, \"end\": 257, \"text\": \"This percentage is calculated from the number of cases monitored by ICW compared to the target for case action during 2021 , then multiplied by 100 percent .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d02\", \"start\": 258, \"end\": 361, \"text\": \"The English , Chinese , Japanese , Arabic , and French versions are automatically generated by the AI .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d02\", \"start\": 362, \"end\": 465, \"text\": \"So there may still be inaccuracies in translating , please always see Indonesian as our main language .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d02\", \"start\": 466, \"end\": 572, \"text\": \"( system supported by DigitalSiber.id ) Tag : korupsi nasional pemberantasan korupsi icw Most Popular Tags\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Corruption Watch\", \"scope\": \"establishment date\", \"claim\": \"Corruption Watch was established in January 2012.\", \"answer\": \"January 2012\", \"quote\": \"Corruption Watch was launched in January 2012 at the initiative of trade union federation COSATU (the Congress of South African Trade Unions).\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0100-fa109d9c792b:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Corruption Watch\", \"scope\": \"establishment date\", \"claim\": \"Corruption Watch was established on June 21, 1998.\", \"answer\": \"June 21, 1998\", \"quote\": \"ICW was created on June 21, 1998, a few weeks after the resignation of President Suharto, by social activist Teten Masduki, lawyer Todung Mulya Lubis, economist Faisal Basri and other persons in the midst of a reform movement aimed at ensuring that any post-Suharto government would be democratic and free of corruption.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"January 2012\", \"June 21, 1998\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"January 2012\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"June 21, 1998\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
